=========================================
JPA REQUIREMENTS
=========================================

Use proper cascade rules.

Use FetchType.LAZY where appropriate.

Use orphanRemoval where appropriate.

Use BigDecimal for all monetary values.

Use LocalDate for dates.

Use LocalDateTime where timestamps are needed.

Add indexes for

receiptNumber

paymentDate

customer

status

=========================================
REPOSITORIES
=========================================

Create

PaymentRepository

PaymentAllocationRepository

PaymentRefundRepository

Each extends JpaRepository.

Do not add custom queries yet.

